# Force LF everywhere. This repo bakes per-file SHA-256 hashes into its own
# release integrity manifest (tests/build-release.py, FILE-INTEGRITY.json) and
# into PRSTUDIO_UC_Health's runtime tamper check -- a checkout that silently
# rewrites LF to CRLF on a Windows contributor's machine (Git's default
# core.autocrlf=true with no .gitattributes) would make those hashes
# unreproducible between contributors even though nothing about the source
# actually changed. Binary formats are listed explicitly so they are never
# touched by line-ending normalization.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
